  "question": {
    "text": "The ground state energy of hydrogen atom is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>–</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>eV</mi></math>. If the electron jumps to the ground state from the 3<sup>rd</sup> excited state, the wavelength of the emitted photon is"
